              '--block-size=M'; see SIZE format below[m
[m
       [1m-B[22m, [1m--ignore-backups[0m[m
              do not list implied entries ending with ~[m
[m
       [1m-c     [22mwith [1m-lt[22m: sort by, and show, ctime (time of last change of file status[m
              information); with [1m-l[22m: show ctime and sort by name; otherwise: sort by[m
              ctime, newest first[m
[m
